  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What moved and what did not",
      "items": [
        "Markup became components; every useState, ref and effect that another part of Shell reads stayed in Shell, so no effect runs in a different order",
        "Two pieces of state moved with their only reader: the card's elapsed clock and the search field's focused flag. A run in flight no longer redraws the rail and the stage once a second"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Checked",
      "items": [
        "The old JSX from git and the new components render identical markup in 48 cases: every card kind and action, every row card case",
        "Stylesheet byte-identical, 90 test files and 1571 tests, React Doctor reports nothing new, and the search, the help overlay and the hover card were driven in the running interface"
      ]
    }
  ]
